# Build
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo.lock is tracked on purpose: this workspace ships binaries
# (pdf-to-ebook, pdf-to-ebook-gui), so the exact dependency set matters.

# Conversion output
# `out/` is scratch from earlier runs over the fixtures in `test/`, not
# fixtures itself. The rest catch runs done anywhere else in the tree.
/out
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw3
*.report.md
*.proofread.md

# Logs and profiling
*.log
*.profraw
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph.svg

# Local environment
.env
.env.local

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Patch and merge leftovers
*.orig
*.rej
